  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "6e553eb6-371c-40b8-a352-b9fb474780d0",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        80,
        -64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Wait for an approval in Inistate\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow is designed to be called by another n8n workflow to create an approval request in Inistate and wait for a final decision. It initializes polling settings, creates the request, then repeatedly waits and checks the request state. When the request reaches an approved or rejected state it returns the decision; if the maximum number of checks is reached, it stops with an error.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Inistate credentials used by the Inistate nodes.\n- Review the Settings node and set the approvedState, rejectedState, checkEveryMinutes, and maxChecks values to match your Inistate process.\n- Ensure the parent workflow passes any required request or document data expected by the Create approval request node.\n- Confirm the Return decision node exposes the fields your calling workflow needs, such as approved, state, and documentId.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the polling interval and max check count to control how long the workflow waits before timing out, and update the approved/rejected state names if your Inistate workflow uses different labels."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3b8fb22b-37ca-4ce9-afb1-3df0d3d0896b",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        640,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Initialize approval request\n\nReceives execution from another workflow, applies approval-related settings, and creates the initial approval request in Inistate."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4f68032e-e09e-435d-b02e-68ba74f37fb6",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1328,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Poll request status\n\nWaits between checks, fetches the latest Inistate request status, and determines whether the approval has reached a final state."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b0861dbe-9022-4e1f-9ac2-e65417b348fd",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2000,
        -64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "height": 368,
        "content": "## Return final decision\n\nFormats and returns the completed approval decision, including whether it was approved, the final state, and the document ID."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "488ec89a-90e9-4260-94cd-3bfcff73af66",
